# hello-dolly — the SET-INDEPENDENT half of this project's env.
#
# Created 2026-08-25. It had none: mock1-paused-run.sh pinned its providers directly
# (export ORCH_GATE_PROVIDER="qwen"), so the project never needed config and could never be
# swapped. A launcher pin is already-set and OUTRANKS config, so that pin had to go for this
# file to mean anything.
#
# Deliberately minimal: only PROJECT_NAME, which is DERIVED from this project's own
# prd.authored.json. Every other setting mock1-paused-run.sh exports at launch (codeline root,
# Jira endpoints, workspace paths) is RUN state, not project identity, and inventing values for
# them here would put facts nobody chose into config.
PROJECT_NAME=hello-dolly

# The topology router asks a model whether a phase runs single, parallel or sequential worktrees.
# Off: the count heuristic decides instead — deterministic, free, and the same answer the router
# was falling back to whenever it returned nothing. Set EPAM_TOPOLOGY to pin a shape outright, or
# EPAM_TOPOLOGY_ROUTER=1 to ask the model again.
EPAM_TOPOLOGY_ROUTER=0
